<title>POLAND: Warta sees 1996 net up to PLN 17.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Warta sees 1996 net up to PLN 17.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurer TUiR Warta SA expects to make a net profit of 17.4 million zlotys this year, 27 percent higher than last year, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement said earnings per share would rise to five zlotys from 3.9 zlotys last year.</p>
<p>Warta currently has shares 3.46 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The statement said Warta would outperform its gross-premium and capital-investment returns targets for this year, but gave no figures.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
